#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
RobinOS installer prototype

This is not a full disk installer yet.

Current recommended flow:
  1. Install Arch Linux with archinstall or the manual Arch guide.
  2. Reboot into the installed system.
  3. Clone or copy the RobinOS repository.
  4. Run: sudo scripts/post-install.sh
  5. Run: robinctl doctor

From the live ISO, the project files are also staged at:
  /opt/robinos

After installing Arch, you can copy that directory into the installed system
and run:
  sudo /opt/robinos/scripts/post-install.sh

The future RobinOS installer will provide guided disk layout, Btrfs snapshots,
desktop setup, Korean defaults, and security lab profiles.
EOF
